@startuml

[*] --> InsertedCard : CardInserted

InsertedCard --> PINEntry : PINEntered
PINEntry --> VerifiedPIN : PINVerified
VerifiedPIN --> OptionsAvailable : UserApprovalGiven
OptionsAvailable --> WithdrawalRequestProcessed : CashDispensed
WithdrawalRequestProcessed --> ReceiptPrinted : ReceiptPrinted
ReceiptPrinted --> CardReturned : TransactionCompleted
CardReturned --> SystemReset : TimeElapsed

SystemReset --> [*]

@enduml
